<%- include('./partials/deadline-head', {
  title: "You're invited to list on " + appName,
  heading: 'Your property has been listed. Set up your account.'
}) %>

<p>An administrator has added your property to <%= appName %>. To manage your listing, review bookings, and receive payouts, you'll need to create your hotel account.</p>

<div class="property-card">
  <p class="label">Your Property</p>
  <p class="name"><%= placeName %></p>
  <p class="location"><%= placeCity %>, <%= placeCountry %></p>
</div>

<p>Click the button below to set your name and password. This link is private &mdash; it was sent only to you and expires in <strong><%= expiryDays %> days</strong>.</p>

<%- include('./partials/deadline-button', { url: inviteUrl, label: 'Create My Account' }) %>

<div class="divider"></div>

<p>If you weren't expecting this email, you can safely ignore it. No account will be created unless you click the link above.</p>
<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; word-break: break-all;">
  If the button doesn't work, copy this link: <%= inviteUrl %>
</p>

<%- include('./partials/deadline-foot', { appName: appName }) %>
